[C1] PASS the six flags become bits 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32; moist physics raises 4 (species repair) and 16 (saturation): saturation alone gives causes = 16
[C2] PASS a MAX reduction of 0/1 flags over ranks is the bitwise OR of every rank's causes: 0 mismatches over all 4096 pairs of two-rank cause sets
[C3] PASS past max_redo a moist cause terminates without restoring; with vic-solve the state is restored first: saturation at 6th attempt ('terminate', False); saturation + vic-solve ('terminate', True); 5th attempt ('redo', True); no cause ('accept', False)
